LupDFW__level-L1 index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__weight-semibold index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__transform-uppercase\",\"style\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"index-module-scss-module__9VM68q__color-lime100\",\"onClick\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":\"Finance\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"index-module-scss-module__szccRa__space-3\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"index-module-scss-module__WznaLG__level-4 index-module-scss-module__WznaLG__title\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"index-module-scss-module__9VM68q__gradient-silver\",\"onClick\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":\"Turn merchants into brands\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"index-module-scss-module__szccRa__space-3\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__paragraph index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__level-B3 index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__variant-tertiary index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__weight-default\",\"style\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"Brand data for every financial interface. Access merchant \",[\"$\",\"br\",null,{\"className\":\"index-module__LcQ79q__hide-sm\"}],\"logos and metadata for transaction feeds \u0026 financial UI.\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"index-module-scss-module__szccRa__space-8\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"index-module-scss-module__AmR4nq__grid index-module-scss-module__AmR4nq__align-start index-module-scss-module__AmR4nq__columns-2x1fr index-module-scss-module__AmR4nq__columns-md-1fr index-module-scss-module__AmR4nq__gap-y-5\",\"style\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"index-module-scss-module__1vxd5W__flex index-module-scss-module__1vxd5W__display-flex index-module-scss-module__1vxd5W__direction-row index-module-scss-module__1vxd5W__justify-start index-module-scss-module__1vxd5W__align-center index-module-scss-module__1vxd5W__gap-0 index-module-scss-module__1vxd5W__gap-x-5 index-module-scss-module__1vxd5W__gap-y-0 index-module-scss-module__1vxd5W__wrap-nowrap\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"onClick\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"index-module__UnFZIa__wrapper index-module__UnFZIa__size-sm index-module__UnFZIa__default\",\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"index-module-scss-module__r1Ax4q__icon index-module-scss-module__r1Ax4q__color-black700 index-module-scss-module__r1Ax4q__size-md\",\"style\":{},\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":\"$L5c\"}]}],\"$L5d\"]}],\"$L5e\",\"$L5f\",\"$L60\"]}],\"$L61\",\"$L62\"]}],\"$L63\"]}]]}]}]\n59:[\"$\",\"$L64\",null,{\"title\":\"Compare plans\"}]\n65:T1a5c,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"text\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eBrand API and Brand Context API each cost 1 credit per call. Each plan includes a monthly credit pool that resets every cycle and doesn\\u0026#39;t carry over. Logo API and Brand Search API run on separate quotas and don\\u0026#39;t consume credits. See the table above for per-plan limits.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"@type\":\"Answer\"},\"name\":\"How does pricing work?\",\"@type\":\"Question\"},{\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"text\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eBrand fetches over your monthly limit are billed at $0.10 each, up to an \\u003ca href=\\\"https://docs.brandfetch.com/brand-api/overview#overage-billing\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\\u003eoverage cap\\u003c/a\\u003e you set. You\\u0026#39;ll get usage alerts at 80% and 100%. Logo API and Brand Search API are soft-capped: going over triggers a notification, not a hard stop.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"@type\":\"Answer\"},\"name\":\"What happens when I exceed my quota?\",\"@type\":\"Question\"},{\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"text\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes, for internal use cases like displaying a logo in your app. Sublicensing the data to your customers or including it in your own API responses requires a specific agreement. \\u003ca href=\\\"https://brandfetch.com/developers/contact/sales\\\"\\u003eContact sales\\u003c/a\\u003e if that\\u0026#39;s your use case.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"@type\":\"Answer\"},\"name\":\"Can I use your data commercially?\",\"@type\":\"Question\"},{\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"text\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes. The Free plan gives you 100 fetches plus free Logo CDN and Brand Search up to 500K requests/mo each, no credit card required. Enough to test most integrations end-to-end. You can also preview the data on our \\u003ca href=\\\"https://brandfetch.com/developers/playground\\\"\\u003eplayground\\u003c/a\\u003e.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"@type\":\"Answer\"},\"name\":\"Can I try Brandfetch before I buy?\",\"@type\":\"Question\"},{\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"text\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eOver 50 million brands and growing, continuously refreshed from the open web. Our APIs also resolve in real time: any brand with a valid domain returns data, across every industry and region.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"@type\":\"Answer\"},\"name\":\"How many brands do you cover?\",\"@type\":\"Question\"},{\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"text\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eNo, but brands can claim and manage their profile directly on \\u003ca href=\\\"https://brandfetch.com\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\\u003ebrandfetch.com\\u003c/a\\u003e, making us the only platform with first-party brand data. Beyond that, our data is aggregated from publicly available sources on the open web.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"@type\":\"Answer\"},\"name\":\"Does Brandfetch obtain each brand's permission?\",\"@type\":\"Question\"},{\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"text\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eUse \\u003ca href=\\\"https://brandfetch.com/developers/logo-api\\\"\\u003eLogo API\\u003c/a\\u003e when you only need a logo, for example to embed a brand mark in your UI. It\\u0026#39;s optimized for that, served via a fast CDN, and runs on its own quota separate from credits.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUse \\u003ca href=\\\"https://brandfetch.com/developers/brand-api\\\"\\u003eBrand API\\u003c/a\\u003e when you need the full brand record: logos, colors, fonts, firmographics, and more in a single call. Brand API responses can be cached for 30 days to reduce credit usage. Logo API images can be cached locally per our \\u003ca href=\\\"https://docs.brandfetch.com/logo-api/overview#usage-guidelines\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\\u003eusage guidelines\\u003c/a\\u003e.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"@type\":\"Answer\"},\"name\":\"When should I use Logo API vs Brand API?\",\"@type\":\"Question\"},{\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"text\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eBrandfetch integrates with several platforms so you can use brand data without writing custom code:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003ca href=\\\"https://docs.brandfetch.com/mcp/overview\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\\u003eMCP\\u003c/a\\u003e for AI agents and assistants\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003ca href=\\\"https://zapier.com/apps/brandfetch/integrations\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\\u003eZapier\\u003c/a\\u003e for automated workflows\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003ca href=\\\"https://n8n.io/integrations/brandfetch/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\\u003en8n\\u003c/a\\u003e for self-hosted automation\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.make.com/en/integrations/brandfetch\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\\u003eMake.com\\u003c/a\\u003e for visual workflow building\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ul\\u003e\",\"@type\":\"Answer\"},\"name\":\"What integrations do you offer?\",\"@type\":\"Question\"},{\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"text\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eBrand data stays fresh through several mechanisms:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eAPI requests trigger a background recrawl if the brand hasn\\u0026#39;t been refreshed in 3 months, so the index stays current with usage\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eClaimed brands are managed directly by their owners, always current\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eCurated brands are managed by our QA team, who also track rebrands across the web\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eCrowdsourced updates flow in continuously from users of our plugins and integrations\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eNeed a brand refreshed now? \\u003ca href=\\\"https://brandfetch.com/update?mode=web\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\\u003eSubmit a brand update request\\u003c/a\\u003e.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"@type\":\"Answer\"},\"name\":\"How often do you update your dataset?\",\"@type\":\"Question\"},{\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"text\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eLogos are delivered in SVG when available, with PNG conversions for broader compatibility. If SVG isn\\u0026#39;t available, you get the highest-quality PNG we can find, with a transparent background. See \\u003ca href=\\\"https://docs.brandfetch.com/reference/brand-api\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\\u003eour docs\\u003c/a\\u003e for more details.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"@type\":\"Answer\"},\"name\":\"What logo formats do you support?\",\"@type\":\"Question\"},{\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"text\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eSubmit your request at \\u003ca href=\\\"https://brandfetch.com/update?mode=web\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\\u003ebrandfetch.com/update\\u003c/a\\u003e. Our QA team will update the brand with its latest information.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"@type\":\"Answer\"},\"name\":\"How do I request a brand update?\",\"@type\":\"Question\"},{\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"text\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes. Qualified startups and nonprofits get 40% off paid plans for the first 12 months. \\u003ca href=\\\"https://brandfetch.com/developers/contact/sales\\\"\\u003eReach out to sales\\u003c/a\\u003e to apply.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"@type\":\"Answer\"},\"name\":\"Do you offer discounts for startups or nonprofits?\",\"@type\":\"Question\"}]}5a:[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$65\"},\"type\":\"application/ld+json\"}],\"$L66\"]\n67:I[424562,[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/08fnvxdhufjjo.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1ikh1axhj3x81.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/36m2qx2otq_ck.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0y1sykrjlnccq.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1ib39l66t47w1.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2-zxmar2m18gu.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/27t1ladud8t3t.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3skrg21wrji49.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/20t83le8-ry3o.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2b-3f__5dp64_.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0xvvg-s2q_r7j.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0wy3w59byl24_.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/426k0cpdvhxhx.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3pojdykrhc42o.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0q9efnmrahjb2.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1ndgzi2v0rqz6.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/29g1x8ououzrk.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0e5-2x-5ekos1.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/006wdv_93hqde.js\"],\"Tooltip\"]\n68:I[567971,[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/08fnvxdhufjjo.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1ikh1axhj3x81.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/36m2qx2otq_ck.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0y1sykrjlnccq.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1ib39l66t47w1.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2-zxmar2m18gu.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/27t1ladud8t3t.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3skrg21wrji49.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/20t83le8-ry3o.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2b-3f__5dp64_.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0xvvg-s2q_r7j.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0wy3w59byl24_.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/426k0cpdvhxhx.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3pojdykrhc42o.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0q9efnmrahjb2.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1ndgzi2v0rqz6.js\",\"/_next/static/immutab