"Access referential brand data\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"index-module-scss-module__szccRa__space-1\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__paragraph index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__level-S1 index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__variant-tertiary index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__weight-default\",\"style\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":\"Tap into a continuously updated database of merchants and their brand identifiers.\"}]]}]}]]}]\n61:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"index-module-scss-module__szccRa__space-10\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}]\n62:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"index-module-scss-module__1vxd5W__flex index-module-scss-module__1vxd5W__display-flex index-module-scss-module__1vxd5W__direction-sm-column index-module-scss-module__1vxd5W__justify-start index-module-scss-module__1vxd5W__align-center index-module-scss-module__1vxd5W__gap-0 index-module-scss-module__1vxd5W__gap-x-6 index-module-scss-module__1vxd5W__gap-y-4 index-module-scss-module__1vxd5W__wrap-nowrap\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L44\",null,{\"href\":\"https://calendly.com/jeremy-jaq/brand-api\",\"width\":{\"sm\":\"full\"},\"target\":\"_blank\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"button\",null,{\"type\":\"button\",\"className\":\"index-module-scss-module__43-cmG__button index-module-scss-module__43-cmG__variant-primary index-module-scss-module__43-cmG__size-sm index-module-scss-module__43-cmG__width-sm-full\",\"disabled\":\"$undefined\",\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$undefined\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Book a demo\"}],\"$undefined\"]}]}],[\"$\",\"$L44\",null,{\"href\":\"/developers/merchant-transaction-enrichment\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"index-module__yLgsXa__anchor index-module__yLgsXa__cursor-pointer index-module__yLgsXa__variant-gray index-module__yLgsXa__weight-semibold index-module__yLgsXa__size-sm\",\"children\":[\"Learn more\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"index-module-scss-module__r1Ax4q__icon index-module-scss-module__r1Ax4q__space-left index-module-scss-module__r1Ax4q__size-sm\",\"style\":{},\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"data-prefix\":\"fal\",\"data-icon\":\"chevron-right\",\"className\":\"svg-inline--fa fa-chevron-right \",\"role\":\"img\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 320 512\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{},\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"fill\":\"currentColor\",\"d\":\"M315.3 244.7c6.2 6.2 6.2 16.4 0 22.6l-208 208c-6.2 6.2-16.4 6.2-22.6 0s-6.2-16.4 0-22.6L281.4 256 84.7 59.3c-6.2-6.2-6.2-16.4 0-22.6s16.4-6.2 22.6 0l208 208z\",\"style\":{}}]}]}]]}]}]]}]\n63:[\"$\",\"$L43\",null,{\"position\":\"relative\",\"height\":\"full\",\"width\":\"full\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"index-module__kTLkiG__imageWrapper\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L68\",null,{}]}]}]\n66:[\"$\",\"$L69\",null,{\"src\":[{\"render\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003cp\u003eBrand API and Brand Context API each cost 1 credit per call. Each plan includes a monthly credit pool that resets every cycle and doesn\u0026#39;t carry over. Logo API and Brand Search API run on separate quotas and don\u0026#39;t consume credits. See the table above for per-plan limits.\u003c/p\u003e\"}}],\"acceptedAnswerText\":\"\u003cp\u003eBrand API and Brand Context API each cost 1 credit per call. Each plan includes a monthly credit pool that resets every cycle and doesn\u0026#39;t carry over. Logo API and Brand Search API run on separate quotas and don\u0026#39;t consume credits. See the table above for per-plan limits.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"questionName\":\"How does pricing work?\"},{\"render\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003cp\u003eBrand fetches over your monthly limit are billed at $0.10 each, up to an \u003ca href=\\\"https://docs.brandfetch.com/brand-api/overview#overage-billing\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003eoverage cap\u003c/a\u003e you set. You\u0026#39;ll get usage alerts at 80% and 100%. Logo API and Brand Search API are soft-capped: going over triggers a notification, not a hard stop.\u003c/p\u003e\"}}],\"acceptedAnswerText\":\"\u003cp\u003eBrand fetches over your monthly limit are billed at $0.10 each, up to an \u003ca href=\\\"https://docs.brandfetch.com/brand-api/overview#overage-billing\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003eoverage cap\u003c/a\u003e you set. You\u0026#39;ll get usage alerts at 80% and 100%. Logo API and Brand Search API are soft-capped: going over triggers a notification, not a hard stop.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"questionName\":\"What happens when I exceed my quota?\"},{\"render\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003cp\u003eYes, for internal use cases like displaying a logo in your app. Sublicensing the data to your customers or including it in your own API responses requires a specific agreement. \u003ca href=\\\"https://brandfetch.com/developers/contact/sales\\\"\u003eContact sales\u003c/a\u003e if that\u0026#39;s your use case.\u003c/p\u003e\"}}],\"acceptedAnswerText\":\"\u003cp\u003eYes, for internal use cases like displaying a logo in your app. Sublicensing the data to your customers or including it in your own API responses requires a specific agreement. \u003ca href=\\\"https://brandfetch.com/developers/contact/sales\\\"\u003eContact sales\u003c/a\u003e if that\u0026#39;s your use case.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"questionName\":\"Can I use your data commercially?\"},{\"render\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003cp\u003eYes. The Free plan gives you 100 fetches plus free Logo CDN and Brand Search up to 500K requests/mo each, no credit card required. Enough to test most integrations end-to-end. You can also preview the data on our \u003ca href=\\\"https://brandfetch.com/developers/playground\\\"\u003eplayground\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\"}}],\"acceptedAnswerText\":\"\u003cp\u003eYes. The Free plan gives you 100 fetches plus free Logo CDN and Brand Search up to 500K requests/mo each, no credit card required. Enough to test most integrations end-to-end. You can also preview the data on our \u003ca href=\\\"https://brandfetch.com/developers/playground\\\"\u003eplayground\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"questionName\":\"Can I try Brandfetch before I buy?\"},{\"render\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003cp\u003eOver 50 million brands and growing, continuously refreshed from the open web. Our APIs also resolve in real time: any brand with a valid domain returns data, across every industry and region.\u003c/p\u003e\"}}],\"acceptedAnswerText\":\"\u003cp\u003eOver 50 million brands and growing, continuously refreshed from the open web. Our APIs also resolve in real time: any brand with a valid domain returns data, across every industry and region.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"questionName\":\"How many brands do you cover?\"},{\"render\":\"$L6a\",\"acceptedAnswerText\":\"\u003cp\u003eNo, but brands can claim and manage their profile directly on \u003ca href=\\\"https://brandfetch.com\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003ebrandfetch.com\u003c/a\u003e, making us the only platform with first-party brand data. Beyond that, our data is aggregated from publicly available sources on the open web.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"questionName\":\"Does Brandfetch obtain each brand's permission?\"},{\"render\":\"$L6b\",\"acceptedAnswerText\":\"\u003cp\u003eUse \u003ca href=\\\"https://brandfetch.com/developers/logo-api\\\"\u003eLogo API\u003c/a\u003e when you only need a logo, for example to embed a brand mark in your UI. It\u0026#39;s optimized for that, served via a fast CDN, and runs on its own quota separate from credits.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eUse \u003ca href=\\\"https://brandfetch.com/developers/brand-api\\\"\u003eBrand API\u003c/a\u003e when you need the full brand record: logos, colors, fonts, firmographics, and more in a single call. Brand API responses can be cached for 30 days to reduce credit usage. Logo API images can be cached locally per our \u003ca href=\\\"https://docs.brandfetch.com/logo-api/overview#usage-guidelines\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003eusage guidelines\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"questionName\":\"When should I use Logo API vs Brand API?\"},{\"render\":\"$L6c\",\"acceptedAnswerText\":\"\u003cp\u003eBrandfetch integrates with several platforms so you can use brand data without writing custom code:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://docs.brandfetch.com/mcp/overview\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003eMCP\u003c/a\u003e for AI agents and assistants\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://zapier.com/apps/brandfetch/integrations\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003eZapier\u003c/a\u003e for automated workflows\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://n8n.io/integrations/brandfetch/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003en8n\u003c/a\u003e for self-hosted automation\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.make.com/en/integrations/brandfetch\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003eMake.com\u003c/a\u003e for visual workflow building\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"questionName\":\"What integrations do you offer?\"},{\"render\":\"$L6d\",\"acceptedAnswerText\":\"\u003cp\u003eBrand data stays fresh through several mechanisms:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eAPI requests trigger a background recrawl if the brand hasn\u0026#39;t been refreshed in 3 months, so the index stays current with usage\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eClaimed brands are managed directly by their owners, always current\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eCurated brands are managed by our QA team, who also track rebrands across the web\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eCrowdsourced updates flow in continuously from users of our plugins and integrations\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eNeed a brand refreshed now? \u003ca href=\\\"https://brandfetch.com/update?mode=web\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003eSubmit a brand update request\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"questionName\":\"How often do you update your dataset?\"},{\"render\":\"$L6e\",\"acceptedAnswerText\":\"\u003cp\u003eLogos are delivered in SVG when available, with PNG conversions for broader compatibility. If SVG isn\u0026#39;t available, you get the highest-quality PNG we can find, with a transparent background. See \u003ca href=\\\"https://docs.brandfetch.com/reference/brand-api\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003eour docs\u003c/a\u003e for more details.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"questionName\":\"What logo formats do you support?\"},{\"render\":\"$L6f\",\"acceptedAnswerText\":\"\u003cp\u003eSubmit your request at \u003ca href=\\\"https://brandfetch.com/update?mode=web\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003ebrandfetch.com/update\u003c/a\u003e. Our QA team will update the brand with its latest information.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"questionName\":\"How do I request a brand update?\"},{\"render\":\"$L70\",\"acceptedAnswerText\":\"\u003cp\u003eYes. Qualified startups and nonprofits get 40% off paid plans for the first 12 months. \u003ca href=\\\"https://brandfetch.com/developers/contact/sales\\\"\u003eReach out to sales\u003c/a\u003e to apply.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"questionName\":\"Do you offer discounts for startups or nonprofits?\"}]}]\n6a:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003cp\u003eNo, but brands can claim and manage their profile directly on \u003ca href=\\\"https://brandfetch.com\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003ebrandfetch.com\u003c/a\u003e, making us the only platform with first-party brand data. Beyond that, our data is aggregated from publicly available sources on the open web.\u003c/p\u003e\"}}]\n6b:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003cp\u003eUse \u003ca href=\\\"https://brandfetch.com/developers/logo-api\\\"\u003eLogo API\u003c/a\u003e when you only need a logo, for example to embed a brand mark in your UI. It\u0026#39;s optimized for that, served via a fast CDN, and runs on its own quota separate from credits.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eUse \u003ca href=\\\"https://brandfetch.com/developers/brand-api\\\"\u003eBrand API\u003c/a\u003e when you need the full brand record: logos, colors, fonts, firmographics, and more in a single call. Brand API responses can be cached for 30 days to reduce credit usage. Logo API images can be cached locally per our \u003ca href=\\\"https://docs.brandfetch.com/logo-api/overview#usage-guidelines\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003eusage guidelines\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\"}}]\n6c:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003cp\u003eBrandfetch integrates with several platforms so you can use brand data without writing custom code:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://docs.brandfetch.com/mcp/overview\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003eMCP\u003c/a\u003e for AI agents and assistants\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://zapier.com/apps/brandfetch/integrations\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003eZapier\u003c/a\u003e for automated workflows\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://n8n.io/integrations/brandfetch/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003en8n\u003c/a\u003e for self-hosted automation\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.make.com/en/integrations/brandfetch\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003eMake.com\u003c/a\u003e for visual workflow building\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"}}]\n6d:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003cp\u003eBrand data stays fresh through several mechanisms:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eAPI requests trigger a background recrawl if the brand hasn\u0026#39;t been refreshed in 3 months, so the index stays current with usage\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eClaimed brands are managed directly by their owners, always current\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eCurated brands are managed by our QA team, who also track rebrands across the web\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eCrowdsourced updates flow in continuously from users of our plugins and integrations\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eNeed a brand refreshed now? \u003ca href=\\\"https://brandfetch.com/update?mode=web\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003eSubmit a brand update request\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\"}}]\n6e:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003cp\u003eLogos are delivered in SVG when available, with PNG conversions for broader compatibility. If SVG isn\u0026#39;t available, you get the highest-quality PNG we can find, with a transparent background. See \u003ca href=\\\"https://docs.brandfetch.com/reference/brand-api\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003eour docs\u003c/a\u003e for more details.\u003c/p\u003e\"}}]\n6f:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003cp\u003eSubmit your request at \u003ca href=\\\"https://brandfetch.com/update?mode=web\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\u003ebrandfetch.com/update\u003c/a\u003e. Our QA team will update the brand with its latest information.\u003c/p\u003e\"}}]\n70:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003cp\u003eYes. Qualified startups and nonprofits get 40% off paid plans for the first 12 months. \u003ca href=\\\"https://brandfetch.com/developers/contact/sales\\\"\u003eReach out to sales\u003c/a\u003e to apply.\u003c/p\u003e\"}}]\n"])</script><script>(function(){function c(){var b=a.contentDocument||(a.contentWindow&&a.contentWindow.document);if(b){var d=b.createElement('script');d.innerHTML="window.__CF$cv$params={r:'a37556d8ca0ed81e',t:'MTc4ODc4MDE4NA=='};var a=document.createElement('script');a.src='/cdn-cgi/challenge-platform/scripts/jsd/main.js';document.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(a);";b.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(d)}}if(document.body){var a=document.createElement('iframe');a.height=1;a.width=1;a.style.position='absolute';a.style.top=0;a.style.left=0;a.style.border='none';a.style.visibility='hidden';document.body.appendChild(a);if('loading'!==document.readyState)c();else if(window.addEventListener)document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',c);else{var e=document.onreadystatechange||function(){};document.onreadystatechange=function(b){e(b);'loading'!==document.readyState&&(document.onreadystatechange=e,c())}}}})();</script></body></html>